# Secrets for alert sinks and heartbeats. Copy to config/alerts.env, then:
#     chmod 600 config/alerts.env
# The systemd unit loads it (EnvironmentFile); config.toml references the
# variables as ${NAME}. alerts.env is gitignored. A sink whose variables are
# unset is disabled with a log line, so leave a line out until you have it.
#
# NTFY_TOKEN=tk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# GATUS_THREADWATCH_TOKEN=change-me
